    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The family",
     "texto": [
      "**爸爸** and **妈妈** mean «dad» and «mom»; **父母**, «parents». **哥哥** is older brother, **弟弟**, younger brother; **姐姐** and **妹妹** are older and younger sister.",
      "**丈夫** means «husband» and **妻子**, «wife». Unlike Spanish, these words have no masculine or feminine forms."
     ],
