     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A very useful measure word",
     "texto": [
      "When counting things and people, you usually need a measure word between the number and the noun. **一个孩子** («a child, a boy or a girl») uses **个**. There is no English word that always matches 个; the article «a» is not enough to translate it."
